{"archive":{"bytes":531495,"complete":true,"hash":null,"images_lost":false,"truncated":false},"cover_img":"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ialqXLchERxU/v0/1200x743.jpg","discovered_at":"2026-09-01T14:13:08.580Z","html":"<html>\n<body>\n<h1>All About Nvidia Chips, AI Hype and What Lies Ahead</h1>\n<p>The blistering stock rally that’s made <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/quote/NVDA:US\">Nvidia Corp.</a> one of the world’s three most valuable companies is based on a number of assumptions. One is that artificial intelligence applications made possible by its semiconductors will become features of the modern economy. Another is that Nvidia, and the patchwork of subcontractors upon which it relies, can meet the exploding demand for its equipment without a hitch.</p>\n<p>The excitement surrounding artificial intelligence has ebbed and flowed, but Nvidia remains the preeminent picks-and-shovels seller in an AI gold rush. Revenue is still soaring, and the order book for the company’s Hopper chip lineup and its successor — Blackwell — is bulging.</p>\n<h3>More From Bloomberg</h3>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-02/nvidia-nears-14-billion-hugging-face-deal-this-week\">\n<article></article>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>Nvidia Nears $14 Billion Hugging Face Deal This Week</p>\n<img alt=\"The Hugging Face website\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iOxPlXGD4ii4/v0/300x225.webp\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-31/nvidia-to-invest-3-5-billion-in-chipmaker-mediatek\">\n<article></article>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>Nvidia to Invest $3.5 Billion in Chipmaker MediaTek</p>\n<img alt=\"Computex 2026 Expo\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iKHKqpv2FoVc/v1/300x225.webp\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-31/anthropic-seals-35-billion-cloud-deal-with-nvidia-backed-lambda\">\n<article></article>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>Anthropic Signs $35 Billion Pact With Nvidia-Backed Lambda</p>\n<img alt=\"Anthropic logo\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iUMJnS057NoI/v0/300x225.webp\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-02/nvidia-partner-gets-strong-demand-for-rare-gpu-tied-loan-in-asia\">\n<article></article>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>Nvidia Partner Gets Strong Demand for Rare GPU-Tied Loan in Asia</p>\n<img alt=\"DATA\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iZCa2tKV8CgQ/v1/300x225.webp\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-01/mediatek-shares-soar-10-after-blockbuster-nvidia-investment\">\n<article></article>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>Nvidia Mega-Deal Ushers MediaTek Into Top AI Chipmaker Club</p>\n<img alt=\"Computex 2026 Expo\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ihU9Bj.JPcvY/v0/300x225.webp\"/>\n<h3>Top Reads</h3>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/graphics/2026-opinion-ai-campaign-ads-need-more-safeguards/\">\n<article></article>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>Welcome to the ‘You Can’t Trust Your Own Eyes’ Election</p>\n<img alt=\"Bloomberg Opinion AI Campaign Ads Homepage Image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iEbJD2acJbW0/v0/-1x-1.webp\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2026-09-01/japan-s-ai-and-chip-gamble-faces-reality-check-in-kioxia-s-rural-hub\">\n<article></article>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>Takaichi's $640 Billion AI Gamble Faces Reality Check in a Struggling City</p>\n<img alt=\"Prime Minister Takaichi, LDP President, Ahead of Lower House Election\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iAIsbv1pUxeA/v0/-1x-1.webp\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2026-09-01/amazon-microsoft-job-cuts-threaten-seattle-s-real-estate-market-sales\">\n<article></article>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>Luxury Homes in Seattle Languish With AI Job Cuts and Taxes Hitting Tech Hub</p>\n<img alt=\"Luxury Real Estate in the Suburbs of Seattle\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/i9FBrx8EUqfU/v2/-1x-1.webp\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2026-09-01/belron-ceo-carlos-brito-on-car-windshield-repair-industry-s-global-growth\">\n<article></article>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>The Ex-Beer Baron Turning Windshield Repair Into a $7.8 Billion-a-Year Empire</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iVQpdrzo2nwI/v1/-1x-1.webp\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","id":"fKHA2s1e","published_at":null,"publisher":"nvidia_news","quality":"thin","source_id":"nvidia_news","tags":[],"text_chars":1348,"title":"Why NVIDIA's New Blackwell Chip Is Key to the Next Stage of AI","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2024-03-19/nvidia-s-nvda-blackwell-b200-chip-why-it-s-so-powerful-what-it-means-for-ai"}
